<title>UK: Baxter finalises RMI buy, sees benefits.</title>
<headline>Baxter finalises RMI buy, sees benefits.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Medical products group Baxter International Inc said in a statement issued in Europe on Tuesday that it had signed a final contract to buy Research Medical Inc, confirming an agreement sealed a month ago.</p>
<p>Baxter said it will pay the equivalent of $23.50 per share in Baxter common stock for each RMI share held, making a total of about $236 million.</p>
<p>These figures confirmed the company's December announcement.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
